# Signing material - the actual keystore must never be committed. CI decodes
# it from the ARKARIUM_RELEASE_KEYSTORE_BASE64 secret at build time instead;
# see .github/workflows/release.yml. If you keep a local copy for manual
# `assembleRelease` builds, it belongs outside the repo or ignored here.
*.keystore
*.jks
release.keystore.b64
